  "enhance": {
    "intro": "闲鱼 iOS 未做证书固定：开屏/曝光计数是 mtop 主网关 acs.m.goofish.com 的路径名（splash.ads / idle.ad.expose），信息流广告则在同域 API 的 JSON 字段里（nextfresh 分区 / item.recommend 的 bizType=mamaAD）。黑洞整网关=废掉 App，正解是 MITM 后按路径 reject，或用 Loon 原生 response.json.jq 只删广告字段、保留 mtop 包络。下列 jq 来自 ddgksf2013 GoofishAds 与 fmz200 blockAds 两个公开模块（后者已在用同域 http-response-jq），默认整段注释；建议逐条启用、真机确认后再加下一条。fmz200 的 circle.visited（最近访问）与 fun.follow.often.visit（常访问）更像功能/历史而非广告，刻意不收。",
    "sources": [
      "https://github.com/ddgksf2013/Rewrite/blob/master/AdBlock/GoofishAds.conf",
      "https://github.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/blob/main/Surge/module/blockAds.module"
    ],
    "mitm_hosts": [
      "acs.m.goofish.com",
      "g-acs.m.goofish.com"
    ],
    "url_regex": [
      "URL-REGEX,^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop.*splash\\.ads,REJECT-DICT",
      "URL-REGEX,^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.idle\\.ad\\.expose,REJECT-DICT"
    ],
    "rewrite_json": [
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.item\\.recommend(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.item.recommend/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.cardList |= map(select(.cardData.bizType != \"mamaAD\"))",
        "note": "商品底部推荐：只删 bizType=mamaAD 的卡片",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.user\\.strategy\\.list(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.user.strategy.list/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.strategies = [{}]",
        "note": "首页右下角悬浮球：留一个空 strategy 占位",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlemtopsearch\\.search\\.shade(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlemtopsearch.search.shade/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.singleShadeWords = [{}]",
        "note": "搜索框预填/热词：留一个空占位",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlemtopsearch\\.item\\.search\\.activate(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlemtopsearch.item.search.activate/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.cardList = [{}]",
        "note": "搜索页「猜你可能找」卡片",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlehome\\.home\\.circle\\.list(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlehome.home.circle.list/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.circleList |= map(select(.bizCode != \"saveMoney\"))",
        "note": "首页顶部 Tab：去掉 saveMoney 推广位",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlehome\\.home\\.nextfresh(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlehome.home.nextfresh/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.homeTopList |= [ .[0] ] | .data.sections |= map(select(.data.bizType == \"item\"))",
        "note": "首页信息流：顶部只留首项、分区只留 item（源模块口径较激进）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlemtopsearch\\.search(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlemtopsearch.search/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.resultList |= map(select(.data.item.main.clickParam.args.biz_type == \"item\"))",
        "note": "搜索结果信息流：只留 item 结果（源模块口径较激进）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.local\\.home(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.local.home/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.sections |= map(select(.data.bizType == \"item\"))",
        "note": "本地信息流：分区只留 item（源模块口径较激进）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idlemtopsearch\\.search\\.discover(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idlemtopsearch.search.discover/1.0/",
        "jq": "del(.data.resultList)",
        "note": "搜索发现页：删除 resultList（源模块口径较激进）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.idle\\.user\\.page\\.my\\.adapter(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.idle.user.page.my.adapter/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.ability=[] | .data.container.sections |= map(select(.sectionBizCode | test(\"head|user|trade\")))",
        "note": "我的页面：清空 ability 并只留 head/user/trade 分区（源模块口径最激进，建议最后单开验证）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.item\\.buy\\.feeds(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.item.buy.feeds/1.0/",
        "jq": "del(.data.sections)",
        "note": "我的页面底部商品推荐：删除 sections（源模块口径较激进）",
        "source": "ddgksf2013"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.group\\.myself\\.banner(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.group.myself.banner/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.bannerList = []",
        "note": "群聊/消息页 banner 位",
        "source": "fmz200"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.circle\\.myself\\.banner/1\\.0(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.circle.myself.banner/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.bannerList = []",
        "note": "圈子页 banner 位",
        "source": "fmz200"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.playboy\\.recommend/2\\.0(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.playboy.recommend/2.0/",
        "jq": ".data.recommends = [] | .data.items = [] | .data.next = false",
        "note": "消息页推荐位",
        "source": "fmz200"
      },
      {
        "url": "^https?://(g-)?acs\\.m\\.goofish\\.com/gw/mtop\\.taobao\\.idle\\.item\\.recommend\\.list(?:/|\\?|$)",
        "sample": "https://acs.m.goofish.com/gw/mtop.taobao.idle.item.recommend.list/1.0/",
        "jq": ".data.cardList = []",
        "note": "商品推荐列表：清空 cardList（fmz200 口径，整列清空）",
        "source": "fmz200"
      }
    ]
  },
